nshot 2023-09-08 122812.png", "id": "996168804943983", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974635_996168808277316_5512783578632717843_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C8vDFW7aEXkQ7kNvwH5o62Q&_nc_oc=Adqh1GnIHbU2p0a8P9poPtTDp2KLqjKMcShYJMwlLhxbz1MZMbLekTvFlUP9jYXkmL8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4irNGbOBPYBS1zmd6lspSgTDemSu0tDpqEBtVXWYrOzg&oe=69FC84C1"}, {"file_name": "Trailer.00_00_30_23.Still001.png", "id": "222821904141208", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974812_222821907474541_2052841613157010489_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BlmsG8ma4t4Q7kNvwFDsHwM&_nc_oc=AdohrP_dfXj6JIvKfFg61h3LPveG2-iJJECygKIDZdYKRuJGsa2_3sdlhZJ4aCNsDdk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7HztA6FV2vkzyul3Q3hJYyDhuD6cfJlFWV-AYv5M3_bw&oe=69FCAB81"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2023-09-10 180945.png", "id": "1003308547591264", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974663_1003308550924597_4301389862031791654_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Am5HP1ofUjgQ7kNvwHy1CvO&_nc_oc=Adq33HBow0Pd_E1D_5glSoPZULOsfvtO4WkwuEVs3S6YZmQAQ1ST0MSgS8dwa66Vi48&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Zxvd_k8swQYPVXDEvam7ebBAsXklItBwH5D49L2f0yg&oe=69FC8DA7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Art_Landscape_2560x144020.png", "id": "6675375442547548", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_6675375449214214_374955904288494240_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_6LSngGl8HEQ7kNvwEq6OTR&_nc_oc=Adp-hr7ZhqWNV_JnNPzXTfZFOhLUf1F8_tAwc5j3VMVHNdrCePOWGI4pzA1092Uo7w4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6H6VIkBhEUun9XoUVtSlQRyspz4ybD9nAixIDUVuMjoQ&oe=69FC7F7A"}, "display_name": "Nightmare Tag", "keywords": [], "long_description": "A multiplayer PvP Horror Experience packed full of INTENSE CHASES & JUMP SCARES! In Nightmare tag, you can either be one of the mortal humans trying to run and hide for your life, geared only with your flashgun, scanner, and a variety of surreal attachments. Or, become the blood-hungry monster to terrify your friends! Nightmare tag will have you and your friends screaming, laughing, yelling, & sweating until your headset runs out of power! \n\nBECOME THE NIGHTMARE: \n- Find & chase your friends before they escape the liminal Dreamscape!\n- Unique controller motion movement to use your claws to run, jump, and tear apart humans!\n- Track & hunt humans using your many abilities!\n- Eliminate all the humans to win as the monster\n\nRUN FOR YOUR LIFE: \n- Join your friends as you Run and Hide from the Nightmare!\n- Hide by being completely motionless, making you invisible to the monster\n- Physical Running Motion allows you to sprint when you are found and need to escape!\n- Your flashgun is your only weapon, use it to see where you're going and stun the monster!\n- Use your scanner to locate the monster, reunite with other humans, find power-ups, and find the objective.\n- Complete the objective win as the humans!\n\nMULTIPLE GAME MODES:\n- VHS Run\n- Quick Tag\n- Elimination (requires General Admission)\n- Capture the Fruit (requires General Admission)\n+ A variety of game and map settings to shake things up!\n\nGENERAL ADMISSION (IAP):\n- Unlock 6 more zones\n- Play Elimination and Capture the Fruit", "short_description": "A multiplayer PvP Horror Experience packed full of INTENSE CHASES & JUMP SCARES! In Nightmare tag, you can either be one of the mortal humans trying to run and hide for your life, geared only with your flashgun, scanner, and a variety of surreal attachments. Or, become the blood-hungry monster to terrify your friends! Nightmare tag will have you and your friends screaming, laughing, yelling, & sweating until your headset runs out of power! "}]}, "developer_name": "Grounded", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.g